    "sections": {
        "description": "WoWmart Lite is a clean, flexible WooCommerce theme that works beautifully for just about any kind of online store you want to build. It comes with everything you need to create a smooth shopping experience—your products look great, customers can find what they're looking for easily, and the whole site adapts perfectly whether someone's browsing on their phone, tablet, or computer. Whether you're selling clothes, tech gadgets, furniture, jewelry, groceries, beauty products, or anything else, WoWmart Lite gives you the tools and flexibility to build a shop that looks professional and works exactly how you want it to."
    },
